<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Sticker Downloads</p>

      <h1>Transparent Sticker Maker</h1>

      <p>
        Generate sticker-style images and download files as PNG or WebP. Use PNG for broad editing
        compatibility and WebP for smaller web assets.
      </p>
       <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">Generate Sticker Files</a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>PNG downloads</h2>

        <p>
          PNG is the safest option for design tools, editing workflows, and checking sticker edges.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>WebP downloads</h2>

        <p>WebP is smaller and useful for websites, previews, and lightweight social assets.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Batch ZIP files</h2>

        <p>
          Select multiple completed stickers in history and download the batch in original, PNG, or WebP format.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Sticker download workflow</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>
          Generate a sticker with a clear subject and a simple sticker-style background direction.
        </li>

        <li>
          Open the sticker detail page for individual downloads or history for batch downloads.
        </li>

        <li>
          Choose PNG when you need editing support, previews, or compatibility with design tools.
        </li>

        <li>
          Choose WebP when you need smaller files for web pages, galleries, or lightweight sharing.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Transparent-style sticker prompt examples</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>cute mascot sticker, clean white border, simple background, PNG-ready design</code>
        <code>flower icon sticker, crisp outline, centered subject, minimal background</code>
        <code>avatar sticker, bold edge, clean silhouette, web-ready sticker asset</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>PNG, WebP, and transparent background notes</h2>

      <p>
        The app delivers completed sticker files as original, PNG, or WebP downloads. PNG is the
        safest format when you need to inspect edges or continue editing in design tools. WebP is
        better when file size matters. For sticker projects that require strict transparent
        backgrounds, check the downloaded file in your editor before final production use.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/sticker-maker-online"}>Sticker Maker Online</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/custom-sticker-maker"}>Custom Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/cute-sticker-ideas"}>Cute Sticker Ideas</.link>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
